# set_entity_data body for a summoned minecraft:slime (NBT Size:2b),
# captured from a vanilla 26.1.2 dedicated server.
#
# Provenance: tools/chat-capture/chicken_experiment.py, session
# target/chicken-capture/bodies/061828_s2c_play_99.bin (one client in the
# world; the summon ran through the server console at the player).
#
# a7 09              entity id 1191 (VarInt)
# 09 03              index 9, serializer 3 (float)
# 41 10 00 00        9.0 — the slime's max health, big-endian IEEE 754
# 10 01              index 16, serializer 1 (VarInt)
# 03                 the slime's size slot: NBT Size 2 sends 3, i.e. Size + 1
# ff                 terminator
#
# Together with the small slime: NBT Size 1 sends health 4.0 and size slot 2;
# NBT Size 2 sends health 9.0 and size slot 3. Health tracks the square of the
# *wire* size slot ((size+1)^2 = 4.0, 9.0) — two measured points, no more.
a7 09 09 03 41 10 00 00 10 01 03 ff
